WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.606
A photograph lying in the dust.

00:03.306 --> 00:06.933
His family signed the back and pressed their thumbprints into it.

00:07.383 --> 00:17.159
It also says: This is the family of Astronaut Duke from Planet Earth, who landed on the Moon on the twentieth of April 1972.
